  "name": "Balanced Summoning (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, the summoner maintains balance by calling on opposing forces when summoning. Whenever he casts a summon monster spell or uses his summon monster ability, he can summon two creatures from a single list 1 or more levels lower than the level of the spell. The two creatures must have alignments that are opposite along at least one axis (chaotic and lawful or evil and good).</p>",
